                         <span id="alg1.l19.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span> child <math id="alg1.l19.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\notin" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>∉</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\notin</annotation></semantics></math> visited <span id="alg1.l19.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">then</span>

