</span></span>
<span id="S4.F3.2.1.5.1.1.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="padding:5pt 3.0pt;">
<span id="S4.F3.2.1.5.1.1.1.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:76.8pt;">
<span id="S4.F3.2.1.5.1.1.1.1.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">Implement secure coding practices wherever applicable</span>
</span></span></span>
<span id="S4.F3.2.1.5.1.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="S4.F3.2.1.5.1.1.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_l ltx_border_t" style="padding:5pt 3.0pt;">
<span id="S4.F3.2.1.5.1.1.1.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:19.9pt;">
<span id="S4.F3.2.1.5.1.1.1.1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center"><span id="S4.F3.2.1.5.1.1.1.1.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">SCP 2</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="S4.F3.2.1.5.1.1.1.1.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="padding:5pt 3.0pt;">
<span id="S4.F3.2.1.5.1.1.1.1.2.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_middle" style="width:76.8pt;">
<span id="S4.F3.2.1.5.1.1.1.1.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">Ensure memory management to prevent leaks and buffer overflows</span>
</span></span></span>
<span id="S4.F3.2.1.5.1.1.1.1.3" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="S4.F3.2.1.5.1.1.1.1.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_middle ltx_border_l ltx_border_t" style="padding:5pt 3.0pt;">
